{'symbol': 'ACGL', 'date': '2021-05-24 09:00:00', 'title': 'CHRISTINE TODD TO JOIN ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD. AS CHIEF INVESTMENT OFFICER', 'text': "PEMBROKE, BERMUDA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ARCH CAPITAL GROUP LTD. [NASDAQ: ACGL] TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHRISTINE TODD WILL JOIN THE COMPANY AS CHIEF INVESTMENT OFFICER (CIO), EFFECTIVE JUNE 7, 2021, SUBJECT TO REGULATORY APPROVAL. IN THIS ROLE, TODD WILL REPORT TO MARC GRANDISSON, CEO OF ACGL, AND WILL HAVE RESPONSIBILITY FOR SETTING THE FIRM'S INVESTMENT STRATEGY AND MANAGING THE DAY-TO-DAY OPERATIONS OF THE INVESTMENT PORTFOLIO. TODD SUCCEEDS W. PRESTON HUTCHINGS WHO IS RETIRING FROM ARCH LATER THIS"}